      "category": "Text",
      "text": "\u00a7 2. Living Wage Policy. Additional Covered Employers, including those that are Covered Employers under the Fair Wages for New Yorkers Act, shall be required to pay their Employees no less than a Living Wage. The requirements of this Section shall apply for the longer of the term of the Financial Assistance or ten years from the later of the date of commencement of the project or the date that the project commences operations.",
